01:19:39.130 --> 01:19:39.880
Dr. Karan Mittal: Okay.

645
01:19:40.250 --> 01:19:43.260
Aarti Ganesh: And the positive emotion was felt in my heart.

646
01:19:44.300 --> 01:19:44.880
Dr. Karan Mittal: Beautiful.

647
01:19:45.000 --> 01:19:48.209
Dr. Karan Mittal: Okay, it's not enough. Anyone else would like to share?

